{
    "readme": "Alternative reference configuration expressing experiment selection as explicit names and prefixes instead of full-match regular expressions. Kept so the alternative in the technical design is specified rather than described, and to make the safety difference testable: the prefix 'contentScopeExperiment1' matches contentScopeExperiment10, whereas the equivalent full-match pattern does not.",
    "features": {
